{"name": "Neuron Activation", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras_big/818dcfb4c10c717f426f1f97808cf3ea.webp?t=1787581089\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/818dcfb4c10c717f426f1f97808cf3ea.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate a futuristic control hub filled with switches, sliders, and strange tasks. Complete fast-paced challenges to satisfy The Board, the corporate entity overseeing your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/817c752d0b1b9d730f664d47fedef06b.poster.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/817c752d0b1b9d730f664d47fedef06b.webm?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/817c752d0b1b9d730f664d47fedef06b.mp4?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras_big/033829b43e7cdcce9d21566c3c2e04af.webp?t=1787581089\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/033829b43e7cdcce9d21566c3c2e04af.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Stay locked in through short, frantic sessions built around dopamine-fueled micro-challenges. Tasks overlap, timers keep moving, and The Board demands your full focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/48022d5d53be4a9bb7e53e06cc90676c.poster.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/48022d5d53be4a9bb7e53e06cc90676c.webm?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/48022d5d53be4a9bb7e53e06cc90676c.mp4?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras_big/763e9b828141fc9a731dafe5e1f035e4.webp?t=1787581089\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/763e9b828141fc9a731dafe5e1f035e4.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Sharpen your multitasking. Juggle several tasks at once, chase the next stimulus, chain actions together. Make the chaos work and beat your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c2e82f9a237452139e07017867b69c4c.poster.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c2e82f9a237452139e07017867b69c4c.webm?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c2e82f9a237452139e07017867b69c4c.mp4?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras_big/8e70c358669c97d033996a0041f03ed2.webp?t=1787581089\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/8e70c358669c97d033996a0041f03ed2.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Handler watches your every move. Receive increasingly strange orders. Make uncomfortable choices. Complete all tasks. Don\u2019t ask questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/aeb4acc2943bf9833a5383d8eab41e39.poster.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/aeb4acc2943bf9833a5383d8eab41e39.webm?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/aeb4acc2943bf9833a5383d8eab41e39.mp4?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras_big/3e8617259908a6eeec7a0703dafffc5f.webp?t=1787581089\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/3e8617259908a6eeec7a0703dafffc5f.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a mouse or touch. Click, tap, drag, and slide through the entire game. Whether you prefer a mouse or the touchscreen on Steam Deck, the flow is built to feel natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/f7bc454a39bb2cd93354b522ab849de1.poster.avif?t=1787581089\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/f7bc454a39bb2cd93354b522ab849de1.webm?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/f7bc454a39bb2cd93354b522ab849de1.mp4?t=1787581089\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Operational Details:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed Tests, Bosses, and other gameplay stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zen Mode with no timers or scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player customization and leveling system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed performance stats</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "A digital fidget box of dopamine-fueled micro-challenges. Push buttons. Shoot targets. Chain actions for higher scores. Complete all tasks. Don\u2019t ask questions.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/7922e77c61ca7662ce29ae140f5f43eb337b2360/header.jpg?t=1787581089", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Arcade", "Casual", "Relaxing", "Puzzle", "Cute", "Logic"], "developers": "DR Studio", "publishers": "DR Studio", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3978110", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "16 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/nwFBw8P3SHs", "first_seen": 1768521600.0, "review_rank": 1375}